WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.780
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.050 --> 01:43.050
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.100 --> 01:43.570
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.570 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 9]

5
01:51.070 --> 01:51.870
What...

6
01:53.200 --> 01:54.229
How could this have happened?

7
01:54.229 --> 01:55.430
He was tortured

8
01:55.840 --> 01:57.430
and had no way of escaping on his own.

9
01:57.430 --> 01:59.009
Someone must have been behind this.

10
01:59.009 --> 02:00.230
It's no easy feat for an outsider

11
02:00.230 --> 02:01.280
to get into the Divine Constable Bureau,

12
02:01.280 --> 02:03.120
let alone get someone out.

13
02:03.950 --> 02:04.760
Could there be

14
02:05.870 --> 02:08.270
a mole within the Divine Constable Bureau?

15
02:09.840 --> 02:11.120
Investigate all personnel

16
02:11.120 --> 02:12.280
in the bureau who were involved

17
02:12.280 --> 02:13.470
in detaining Lou Tianming!

18
02:13.470 --> 02:14.130
Yes, Chief.

19
02:15.240 --> 02:15.960
Who was the last person

20
02:15.960 --> 02:17.120
to come into contact

21
02:17.120 --> 02:18.180
with Lou Tianming?

22
02:18.630 --> 02:19.520
Chief,

23
02:19.800 --> 02:21.370
it was Eunuch Zhao from the Eastern Palace.

24
02:21.370 --> 02:22.470
But I don't think it makes sense

25
02:22.470 --> 02:23.520
to say that Eunuch Zhao

26
02:23.520 --> 02:24.750
did this.

27
02:24.840 --> 02:25.910
You specifically ordered us

28
02:25.910 --> 02:27.120
to avoid any mistakes when someone

29
02:27.120 --> 02:28.700
from the Eastern Palace came for investigation.

30
02:28.700 --> 02:29.560
So Ding Mao and I were

31
02:29.560 --> 02:31.690
watching from the side the whole time.

32
02:31.740 --> 02:33.800
It's just that Eunuch Zhao was too close to him

33
02:33.800 --> 02:35.120
and almost got his ear bitten off,

34
02:35.120 --> 02:36.430
and I stopped it. Other than that,

35
02:36.430 --> 02:37.760
nothing else happened.

36
02:39.690 --> 02:43.120
[Crown Prince's residence]

37
02:40.400 --> 02:41.240
You silly servant!

38
02:41.240 --> 02:42.360
Please spare me!

39
02:44.310 --> 02:45.400
Your Highness, I'm begging you!

40
02:45.400 --> 02:46.470
Could you please stop hitting me?

41
02:46.470 --> 02:48.370
The Court of Judicial Review didn't interfere!

42
02:48.370 --> 02:50.030
Please spare me! I beg you!

43
02:50.030 --> 02:51.910
The Ministry of Justice didn't dare to interfere!

44
02:51.910 --> 02:53.910
The Divine Constable Bureau was also just watching!

45
02:53.910 --> 02:54.590
You...

46
02:54.710 --> 02:55.710
Only you!

47
02:56.710 --> 02:58.280
You thick-headed moron!

48
02:58.870 --> 03:01.030
You rushed to interrogate Lou Tianming,

49
03:01.030 --> 03:02.750
and now he's escaped!

50
03:04.840 --> 03:06.150
Your Highness!

51
03:06.470 --> 03:08.110
Lou Tianming's escape

52
03:08.130 --> 03:10.430
has absolutely nothing to do with me!

53
03:10.430 --> 03:11.190
Obviously!

54
03:12.000 --> 03:13.860
Do you even have the brains for it?

55
03:15.150 --> 03:15.960
Now,

56
03:16.870 --> 03:18.870
only you approached Lou Tianming.

57
03:19.030 --> 03:21.310
Even if His Majesty doesn't blame me,

58
03:22.079 --> 03:25.120
in his heart, that bastard, Zhou Miao,

59
03:25.840 --> 03:27.310
has one-upped me

60
03:27.310 --> 03:28.710
once again!

61
03:33.079 --> 03:34.000
Wait, Your Highness!

62
03:34.000 --> 03:34.870
You can't get anything done.

63
03:34.870 --> 03:36.030
You're going to beat me to death!

64
03:36.030 --> 03:37.310
Yet you're great at ruining things!

65
03:37.310 --> 03:38.000
Please stop, Your Highness.

66
03:38.000 --> 03:39.470
You silly servant!

67
03:47.120 --> 03:47.980
Your Highness.

68
03:48.710 --> 03:51.770
Even if you want to punish your servant, Your Highness,

69
03:53.900 --> 03:56.690
[Chu Huan'er, Crown Princess]

70
03:54.190 --> 03:56.840
you should still leave him some dignity.

71
03:58.630 --> 04:00.830
You shouldn't humiliate him in public.

72
04:06.710 --> 04:08.110
You are my wife,

73
04:08.800 --> 04:10.630
the Crown Princess!

74
04:12.580 --> 04:13.630
You took the whip

75
04:13.630 --> 04:15.630
just to plead for a servant?

76
04:20.630 --> 04:22.430
You truly are the widely praised

77
04:22.480 --> 04:24.690
virtuous Crown Princess in Tianhuang City.

78
04:24.690 --> 04:26.150
Virtuous Crown Princess!

79
04:29.130 --> 04:30.400
Everyone says

80
04:30.630 --> 04:31.630
that I, the Crown Prince, have never

81
04:31.630 --> 04:32.830
done anything good.

82
04:34.070 --> 04:36.360
But the only thing I did right

83
04:36.360 --> 04:37.510
was

84
04:38.550 --> 04:40.370
marrying you.

85
04:41.200 --> 04:42.060
Your Highness,

86
04:42.620 --> 04:44.080
they praise me too highly.

87
04:44.560 --> 04:45.390
Your Highness!

88
04:45.390 --> 04:47.510
It's all my fault!

89
04:47.510 --> 04:49.240
It's only right that you beat me!

90
04:49.240 --> 04:51.070
Look at me! I have thick skin!

91
04:51.070 --> 04:52.180
You can hit me freely!

92
04:52.180 --> 04:54.360
But the Crown Princess is precious and of noble birth!

93
04:54.360 --> 04:56.070
If she gets hurt because of me,

94
04:56.480 --> 04:57.560
even my death

95
04:57.560 --> 05:00.480
-can't make up for it, Your Highness! -Your Highness,

96
05:00.480 --> 05:02.390
considering all the years

97
05:02.430 --> 05:03.720
Eunuch Zhao has taken good care

98
05:03.720 --> 05:05.190
of our child, Ye'er,

99
05:05.600 --> 05:07.950
please spare him this time.

100
05:19.830 --> 05:21.230
Sing from the beginning!

101
05:23.270 --> 05:26.560
Is there really a mole in the Divine Constable Bureau?

102
05:30.030 --> 05:31.950
[Entry Records of Divine Constable Bureau's Prison]

103
05:38.770 --> 05:40.050
[Entry Records of Divine Constable Bureau's Prison]

104
05:40.180 --> 05:41.020
[Criminal, Wang, Mrs. Zhao] [Crime: Cursed the officer with voodoo]

105
05:41.020 --> 05:41.870
[Punishment: Confinement in the women's prison]

106
05:52.040 --> 05:53.370
His Majesty has ordered

107
05:53.830 --> 05:56.040
the Divine Constable Bureau to only imprison him,

108
05:56.040 --> 05:57.440
but not interrogate him.

109
05:57.920 --> 05:59.000
Who on earth

110
05:59.000 --> 06:00.830
can enter and exit the dungeon freely

111
06:00.830 --> 06:02.490
without arousing suspicion?

112
06:05.680 --> 06:06.540
Your Highness,

113
06:07.390 --> 06:11.190
Ye'er's condition hasn't taken a turn for the better for a long time.

114
06:11.190 --> 06:12.000
I'd like

115
06:12.310 --> 06:14.630
to use my savings from over the years

116
06:15.000 --> 06:17.460
to rebuild the Buddhist hall in our mansion.

117
06:18.270 --> 06:19.940
I want to be more frugal myself,

118
06:19.940 --> 06:22.370
so I can accumulate more merit for Ye'er.

119
06:23.640 --> 06:26.410
Ye'er has been ill for a long time.

120
06:27.240 --> 06:28.250
I think it must be...

121
06:28.250 --> 06:29.660
Do you mean that

122
06:31.190 --> 06:33.520
I, the Crown Prince, am immoral

123
06:33.550 --> 06:35.300
and devoid of dignity and conscience,

124
06:35.300 --> 06:37.560
diminishing Ye'er's merit?

125
06:38.240 --> 06:39.090
Listen,

126
06:39.110 --> 06:40.460
Ye'er's poor health

127
06:41.110 --> 06:42.430
is all your fault!

128
06:42.510 --> 06:44.720
I, the Crown Prince, have a broad face and a fine jaw

129
06:44.720 --> 06:46.240
and am full of vigor!

130
06:46.510 --> 06:48.570
That little brat you gave birth to

131
06:48.590 --> 06:51.070
is scrawny and sickly!

132
06:51.070 --> 06:52.390
How is he like me at all?

133
06:52.390 --> 06:53.250
Your Highness!

134
06:53.920 --> 06:56.240
Ye'er is smart, wise,

135
06:56.390 --> 06:57.680
generous, kind, and virtuous.

136
06:57.680 --> 06:59.560
How is he not like you?

137
06:59.590 --> 07:00.920
Cut the crap!

138
07:00.950 --> 07:01.600
Were it not for

139
07:01.600 --> 07:02.680
your useless womb,

140
07:02.680 --> 07:04.240
only giving birth to one child in all these years,

141
07:04.240 --> 07:05.040
would His Majesty let

142
07:05.040 --> 07:07.070
Zhou Miao take charge of the Ministry of Justice?

143
07:07.070 --> 07:08.480
He is coveting my position

144
07:08.480 --> 07:09.480
as Crown Prince.

145
07:09.830 --> 07:11.240
This is all your fault.

146
07:11.680 --> 07:13.200
You are a disaster,

147
07:13.310 --> 07:14.830
the root of the problem.

148
07:15.070 --> 07:16.680
You were born a commoner!

149
07:16.800 --> 07:18.720
Being able to marry me

150
07:18.720 --> 07:19.600
is a favor

151
07:19.680 --> 07:21.310
I bestowed upon you,

152
07:21.390 --> 07:24.250
thanks to the merit accumulated by your ancestors!

153
07:32.830 --> 07:34.710
Go kneel in the Buddhist hall.

154
07:35.270 --> 07:37.480
Kneel for 6 hours first.

155
07:40.350 --> 07:41.680
Go now!

156
07:52.680 --> 07:53.800
I suggest

157
07:54.480 --> 07:56.480
that the truth of the black chest case

158
07:56.480 --> 07:57.630
be made public.

159
07:58.120 --> 07:59.000
The truth?

160
07:59.480 --> 08:02.120
Can the truth make Northern Kun withdraw their troops?

161
08:02.120 --> 08:03.240
Can your truth

162
08:03.240 --> 08:04.920
bring an extra 100,000 soldiers

163
08:04.920 --> 08:06.600
or 100,000 provisions?

164
08:10.270 --> 08:12.870
The truth restores justice in people's hearts

165
08:12.870 --> 08:14.680
and distinguishes right from wrong.

166
08:14.680 --> 08:16.480
With justice on our side, we will be confident.

167
08:16.480 --> 08:19.240
With confidence, the army and their commander will stay unbreakable.

168
08:19.240 --> 08:20.870
Northern Kun used Wen Bu's death

169
08:20.870 --> 08:22.390
as an excuse for their southward invasion,

170
08:22.390 --> 08:24.040
with their army approaching Great Shi.

171
08:24.040 --> 08:25.830
If we can prove

172
08:25.830 --> 08:27.240
that Wen Bu faked his death...

173
08:27.240 --> 08:29.100
He has already turned into water.

174
08:29.800 --> 08:31.360
How can we prove it?

175
08:32.720 --> 08:33.630
What if we

176
08:34.390 --> 08:35.669
bring the real Wen Bu

177
08:35.669 --> 08:37.669
to the army?

178
08:41.909 --> 08:44.080
Wen Bu is in Great Shi?

179
08:44.860 --> 08:45.840
To fake

180
08:45.840 --> 08:47.510
his death,

181
08:47.600 --> 08:49.870
Wen Bu absolutely couldn't stay in Northern Kun,

182
08:49.870 --> 08:50.670
and he wouldn't have

183
08:50.670 --> 08:52.140
too many people protecting him by his side.

184
08:52.140 --> 08:53.930
As long as we find Wen Bu,

185
08:54.480 --> 08:56.280
we can just break this deadlock.

186
09:01.440 --> 09:03.200
Divine Constable Bureau, deploy all members!

187
09:03.200 --> 09:04.910
You must catch Wen Bu

188
09:04.910 --> 09:06.080
and Lou Tianming!

189
09:06.390 --> 09:07.200
-Understood! -Understood!

190
09:06.750 --> 09:07.310
[Chief Constable's Hall]

191
09:07.670 --> 09:08.670
The amount of the bounty

192
09:08.670 --> 09:09.720
has been counted

193
09:09.720 --> 09:11.080
according to the usual practice.

194
09:11.080 --> 09:11.840
Anyone who provides

195
09:11.840 --> 09:13.080
the whereabouts of Wen Bu and Lou Tianming

196
09:13.080 --> 09:14.160
will be rewarded with 50 taels of silver.

197
09:14.160 --> 09:15.480
500 taels of silver for capturing the two wanted men.

198
09:15.480 --> 09:17.240
Please sign and seal, My Lord, My Lady.

199
09:15.740 --> 09:16.030
[Special Notice from the Divine Constable Bureau]

200
09:17.210 --> 09:18.070
[Wanted]

201
09:18.130 --> 09:19.620
[Tianhuang City]

202
09:18.510 --> 09:19.480
On land,

203
09:19.480 --> 09:21.270
the Divine Constable Bureau will use post horses

204
09:19.730 --> 09:21.140
[Wen Bu] [Lou Tiantian]

205
09:21.270 --> 09:22.870
to block every key post house in advance and cut off

206
09:22.870 --> 09:24.270
-their access to horses and supplies. -Take a look.

207
09:24.270 --> 09:25.510
Have you seen this person?

208
09:25.510 --> 09:26.400
No.

209
09:26.370 --> 09:29.920
[Proclamation]

210
09:26.480 --> 09:27.480
By water,

211
09:27.480 --> 09:29.030
we will use the water vein tracking technique,

212
09:29.030 --> 09:29.790
relying on the current

213
09:29.790 --> 09:31.910
to spread news to downstream fishing villages and ferries.

214
09:31.910 --> 09:33.240
Fishermen who find the pills and report to the authorities

215
09:33.240 --> 09:35.040
will get their rewards of money.

216
09:44.600 --> 09:45.390
Chief.

217
09:46.240 --> 09:47.150
No clues.

218
09:47.600 --> 09:48.750
It's been 3 days,

219
09:49.030 --> 09:50.480
and there is still no trace?

220
09:50.480 --> 09:51.340
Could it be that

221
09:51.840 --> 09:54.440
they have already left the Great Shi territory?

222
09:54.440 --> 09:55.440
Be patient.

223
09:56.030 --> 09:58.030
Maybe there will be a turning point.

224
09:58.270 --> 09:59.720
After all, our Divine Constable Bureau

225
09:59.720 --> 10:01.120
is full of hidden talents,

226
10:01.120 --> 10:03.050
each with their own unique skills.

227
10:10.320 --> 10:11.120
Young Master,

228
10:11.600 --> 10:12.870
I can't do anything about

229
10:12.870 --> 10:13.840
Constable Meng's injury.

230
10:13.840 --> 10:14.270
Please

231
10:14.270 --> 10:15.870
don't call me over again.

232
10:16.480 --> 10:17.240
I know.

233
10:17.630 --> 10:19.760
I'm not here to ask you to save Meng Rui.

234
10:25.700 --> 10:27.190
Let me see.

235
10:27.440 --> 10:28.900
If you can't save Meng Rui,

236
10:30.270 --> 10:31.550
can you save this?

237
11:53.200 --> 11:55.000
Lou Tianming, Lou Tianming.

238
11:55.020 --> 11:56.270
You kept saying that

239
11:56.270 --> 11:58.240
your black chest plan was flawless

240
11:58.360 --> 12:00.160
and would definitely kill Bai Qi

241
12:00.240 --> 12:03.480
to eliminate a great threat to Northern Kun's southern expedition.

242
12:03.480 --> 12:04.390
And the result?

243
12:05.200 --> 12:06.550
I also heard

244
12:06.570 --> 12:09.500
that you were caught by the Divine Constable Bureau.

245
12:11.200 --> 12:12.000
It seems that

246
12:12.870 --> 12:14.200
the Kingdom of Liluo and the demons

247
12:14.200 --> 12:15.080
you mentioned

248
12:15.080 --> 12:16.230
aren't that great.

249
12:20.750 --> 12:22.080
I've been traveling all the way

250
12:22.080 --> 12:22.840
and finally

251
12:22.840 --> 12:24.670
escaped the encirclement of the Divine Constable Bureau.

252
12:24.670 --> 12:26.080
I'm really starving.

253
12:26.750 --> 12:28.600
I wonder if you, Prince Wenbu,

254
12:28.790 --> 12:31.000
could give me some food.

255
12:54.360 --> 12:56.080
What a fine piece of meat.

256
12:57.000 --> 12:59.000
It's a pity I'm not a beast.

257
12:59.620 --> 13:01.820
How could I eat raw meat and drink blood?

258
13:02.840 --> 13:03.910
But you,

259
13:04.440 --> 13:06.370
who sacrificed your subordinates

260
13:07.000 --> 13:09.000
and disregarded the common people,

261
13:09.960 --> 13:13.000
truly deserve the word "beast."

262
13:13.240 --> 13:14.200
What did you say?

263
13:28.390 --> 13:30.600
We once met at the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

264
13:30.600 --> 13:32.750
You are Young Master Qingyang, Li Si.

265
13:33.150 --> 13:35.290
A powerful master like Yan Zige

266
13:35.670 --> 13:37.720
served you and died for you.

267
13:38.350 --> 13:40.310
Calling you a beast just now

268
13:40.420 --> 13:41.940
is an insult to beasts.

269
13:42.560 --> 13:44.560
Beasts don't harm their own kind.

270
13:44.840 --> 13:45.720
But you do.

271
13:47.750 --> 13:50.320
How dare Lou Tianming betray me!

272
13:50.790 --> 13:51.600
You're wrong.

273
13:52.750 --> 13:55.550
Lou Tianming didn't say anything.

274
13:56.000 --> 13:57.360
It was just my guess.

275
13:57.630 --> 14:00.080
For Lou Tianming to establish contact

276
14:00.080 --> 14:01.480
with you, Your Highness,

277
14:01.790 --> 14:02.670
he must have used

278
14:02.670 --> 14:04.270
something to send messages.

279
14:04.790 --> 14:06.240
The carrier pigeons of the Divine Constable Bureau

280
14:06.240 --> 14:08.000
are all recorded when they come and go.

281
14:08.000 --> 14:10.060
Lou Tianming wouldn't dare use them.

282
14:10.730 --> 14:12.190
So I guessed...

283
14:15.000 --> 14:16.000
What he used

284
14:16.390 --> 14:18.200
must be his falcon.

285
14:20.870 --> 14:22.600
The night the demons attacked,

286
14:22.720 --> 14:24.720
it happened to fall right at my feet.

287
14:25.550 --> 14:28.150
I asked a doctor to heal it.

288
14:28.790 --> 14:31.240
I trained it a bit

289
14:31.630 --> 14:32.670
and followed it.

290
14:33.390 --> 14:34.320
It naturally

291
14:34.320 --> 14:35.390
led me here.

292
14:43.340 --> 14:44.740
Your Highness,

293
14:46.510 --> 14:47.860
don't worry.

294
14:48.630 --> 14:50.910
I am just a trainee constable

295
14:50.910 --> 14:52.640
of the Divine Constable Bureau

296
14:52.790 --> 14:54.790
with no authority to deploy people.

297
14:55.240 --> 14:56.390
I came here

298
14:57.030 --> 14:58.550
alone.

299
15:08.150 --> 15:09.390
In this case,

300
15:09.440 --> 15:11.720
what can you do to me by yourself?

301
15:37.630 --> 15:39.960
The 6 ancient gods of Liluo—

302
15:40.670 --> 15:44.480
Immortality, Prophecy, Lies,

303
15:41.410 --> 15:44.250
[God of Prophecy, Rangnan]

304
15:45.000 --> 15:49.390
Hatred, Disaster, and Death.

305
15:51.630 --> 15:54.290
Now that the mystery of the black chest is solved

306
15:54.760 --> 15:57.820
and the God of Prophecy has finally fallen,

307
15:58.840 --> 16:02.240
cheer, rejoice,

308
16:02.550 --> 16:04.820
and turn a blind eye.

309
16:06.440 --> 16:09.630
This is my gift to Great Shi.

310
16:10.490 --> 16:13.330
I hope you like it.

311
16:14.700 --> 16:16.050
Your Majesty,

312
16:16.150 --> 16:18.120
Wenbu has confessed everything.

313
16:18.440 --> 16:19.440
Behind Lou Tianming,

314
16:19.440 --> 16:21.030
there is a mysterious organization

315
16:21.030 --> 16:22.290
called the Dark Night.

316
16:22.480 --> 16:23.960
Its members are all

317
16:23.960 --> 16:26.210
formidable killers who are neither human nor ghost.

318
16:26.210 --> 16:27.320
The Dark Night?

319
16:29.000 --> 16:31.060
What does the Dark Night stand to gain

320
16:31.360 --> 16:33.160
by conspiring with Northern Kun

321
16:34.480 --> 16:37.200
against our Great Shi?

322
16:37.550 --> 16:39.150
All members of the Dark Night

323
16:40.000 --> 16:41.670
swear allegiance to Liluo.

324
16:44.440 --> 16:46.500
In the third year of Zhengwu's reign,

325
16:47.380 --> 16:50.060
the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi wiped out Liluo.

326
16:51.630 --> 16:52.630
Who would have thought

327
16:52.630 --> 16:54.240
that decades later,

328
16:55.360 --> 16:57.140
these remnants of Liluo

329
16:57.240 --> 16:59.790
would still be plotting a rebellion?

330
17:02.030 --> 17:04.720
That's all Wenbu knows.

331
17:05.069 --> 17:06.829
I've sent him to the Envoy Residence

332
17:06.829 --> 17:08.000
and placed him under strict guard.

333
17:08.000 --> 17:09.640
He awaits Your Majesty's judgment.

334
17:09.640 --> 17:11.550
I ordered you to capture Meng Rui

335
17:11.550 --> 17:13.109
and give me an explanation.

336
17:13.349 --> 17:14.160
Yet you

337
17:15.240 --> 17:16.230
brought me news

338
17:16.230 --> 17:17.960
of the people of Liluo instead.

339
17:20.270 --> 17:21.790
You did well.

340
17:23.240 --> 17:24.270
But, Shan,

341
17:25.589 --> 17:26.750
this is the first time

342
17:26.750 --> 17:28.480
you've gone against my wishes.

343
17:30.200 --> 17:32.510
Meng Rui is neither kin nor friend to you.

344
17:32.680 --> 17:34.880
Why are you protecting him so fiercely?

345
17:34.960 --> 17:36.480
What I protect

346
17:37.070 --> 17:38.350
is not Meng Rui,

347
17:38.880 --> 17:40.680
but justice and righteousness,

348
17:41.270 --> 17:43.070
the truth and public sentiment.

349
17:50.000 --> 17:52.110
Years ago, I told your sister

350
17:52.790 --> 17:54.920
that I could find you a good match.

351
17:55.640 --> 17:57.240
Among all the court officials,

352
17:57.240 --> 17:59.000
royal relatives and nobles,

353
17:59.440 --> 18:00.840
you could take your pick.

354
18:02.160 --> 18:04.760
Why bring this up all of a sudden, Your Majesty?

355
18:06.270 --> 18:07.880
You refused at the time.

356
18:09.000 --> 18:09.790
You said,

357
18:10.270 --> 18:12.830
since your sister had already married into the royal family,

358
18:12.830 --> 18:13.640
then

359
18:14.000 --> 18:16.530
you wished only to serve the court faithfully

360
18:16.590 --> 18:19.590
and insisted on joining the Divine Constable Bureau.

361
18:20.240 --> 18:21.920
I hesitated then.

362
18:23.030 --> 18:23.960
Do you know

363
18:24.960 --> 18:26.510
why I hesitated?

364
18:28.000 --> 18:31.010
The Divine Constable Bureau stands outside the Six Ministries.

365
18:31.010 --> 18:33.010
It is Your Majesty's eyes and hands.

366
18:33.440 --> 18:35.830
But my elder sister was already Empress,

367
18:35.830 --> 18:37.230
ruling the inner palace.

368
18:37.240 --> 18:40.200
If I became Chief Commissioner as well,

369
18:41.750 --> 18:43.680
then the Xuanyuan family might...

370
18:45.440 --> 18:48.680
might be suspected of abusing its power as imperial in-laws.

371
18:48.680 --> 18:50.750
So I made you swear an oath.

372
18:51.270 --> 18:53.550
If you joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

373
18:53.550 --> 18:55.590
you could never marry in your lifetime,

374
18:55.590 --> 18:56.750
nor have children.

375
18:57.880 --> 18:59.400
Because the position of Chief Commissioner

376
18:59.400 --> 19:00.350
of the Divine Constable Bureau

377
19:00.350 --> 19:02.080
allows no personal interests.

378
19:03.000 --> 19:05.270
The only family you could have in this lifetime

379
19:05.270 --> 19:06.550
would be me.

380
19:11.590 --> 19:13.750
I understand, Your Majesty.

381
19:15.160 --> 19:17.030
Investigate Liluo and Lou Tianming

382
19:17.030 --> 19:17.960
together.

383
19:19.550 --> 19:21.960
The Divine Constable Bureau is heavily guarded.

384
19:21.960 --> 19:23.400
Without an insider,

385
19:24.500 --> 19:26.190
how could they have escaped?

386
19:28.350 --> 19:29.160
Yes, Your Majesty.

387
19:29.060 --> 19:31.790
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

388
19:40.600 --> 19:42.200
This is truly divine nectar.

389
19:52.070 --> 19:53.050
You forcibly activated

390
19:53.050 --> 19:54.640
the Soaring Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation,

391
19:54.640 --> 19:56.590
and you're suffering internal injuries too.

392
19:56.590 --> 19:58.240
Yet you still want to drink?

393
19:58.790 --> 19:59.990
Are you trying to die?

394
20:05.550 --> 20:07.000
These past few days, Tianhuang City

395
20:07.000 --> 20:08.480
has been searching for Meng Rui everywhere.

396
20:08.480 --> 20:09.440
Looks like the Emperor,

397
20:09.440 --> 20:10.790
regardless of the truth,

398
20:10.790 --> 20:12.390
is determined to use Meng Rui

399
20:12.680 --> 20:14.740
to give Northern Kun an explanation.

400
20:16.030 --> 20:17.240
This scene

401
20:17.790 --> 20:19.590
is just like 17 years ago.

402
20:27.640 --> 20:28.680
Do you happen to know

403
20:28.680 --> 20:30.160
where Meng Rui is?

404
20:32.030 --> 20:32.790
What?

405
20:33.480 --> 20:35.510
You won't even tell your own master?

406
20:39.650 --> 20:42.060
I don't want to know anyway.

407
20:42.240 --> 20:43.210
Seriously.

408
20:46.550 --> 20:48.400
Using the investigation as an excuse,

409
20:48.400 --> 20:49.270
you've met

410
20:49.270 --> 20:50.600
Zhou Miao and Zhou Tiao.

411
20:51.030 --> 20:51.790
How is it?

412
20:52.440 --> 20:53.790
Did you find anything?

413
21:04.030 --> 21:05.230
Seventeen years ago,

414
21:05.270 --> 21:07.240
Big Brother falsely reported a military emergency

415
21:07.240 --> 21:08.350
to lure Father away

416
21:09.350 --> 21:11.030
and then notified Second Brother.

417
21:11.030 --> 21:13.720
The two of them conspired together

418
21:14.790 --> 21:17.590
and tried to kill me at Mulan Hunting Grounds.

419
21:18.790 --> 21:19.790
After I died,

420
21:20.200 --> 21:21.400
Father learned about

421
21:21.640 --> 21:23.170
the false military report.

422
21:25.400 --> 21:27.260
Big Brother took responsibility

423
21:27.300 --> 21:30.440
and voluntarily gave up his position in the Ministry of War.

424
21:30.440 --> 21:31.880
He also had everyone

425
21:32.000 --> 21:34.100
in the Ministry of War who knew the truth

426
21:34.100 --> 21:35.390
silenced.

427
21:38.070 --> 21:39.130
If that's the case,

428
21:39.530 --> 21:41.060
what are you planning to do?

429
21:46.250 --> 21:47.450
I know Father well.

430
21:48.700 --> 21:49.900
Seventeen years ago,

431
21:50.380 --> 21:51.650
he buried the truth

432
21:52.350 --> 21:54.320
and chose not to pursue Big Brother or Second Brother.

433
21:54.320 --> 21:55.390
That shows

434
21:57.680 --> 21:59.380
that in his heart,

435
21:59.960 --> 22:02.490
he cares only about keeping the court stable.

436
22:03.290 --> 22:05.050
If you truly wanted revenge,

437
22:05.150 --> 22:06.380
seventeen years ago,

438
22:06.930 --> 22:08.730
you could have gone straight

439
22:08.870 --> 22:10.410
to your father, regardless of the consequences.

440
22:10.410 --> 22:11.680
At least you could have

441
22:11.710 --> 22:13.310
forced a lose-lose outcome.

442
22:13.540 --> 22:14.670
But you didn't.

443
22:20.440 --> 22:21.240
Now,

444
22:21.880 --> 22:23.480
what else can I do

445
22:23.500 --> 22:25.630
besides secretly gathering evidence

446
22:26.200 --> 22:28.060
and waiting for the right moment?

447
22:28.750 --> 22:31.000
There's just one thing

448
22:32.000 --> 22:34.400
I need to investigate at Tianshu Pavilion.

449
22:36.960 --> 22:38.260
Mr. Meng

450
22:38.280 --> 22:40.000
really had a brush with death this time.

451
22:40.000 --> 22:40.510
Meng Rui!

452
22:40.510 --> 22:41.200
Who is that?

453
22:41.200 --> 22:41.790
Little Ice Cube.

454
22:41.790 --> 22:42.310
Mr. Yan.

455
22:42.310 --> 22:42.760
Where is he?

456
22:42.760 --> 22:43.960
-Mr. Yan. -Mr. Yan.

457
22:44.240 --> 22:45.280
This...

458
22:46.500 --> 22:48.120
What happened, Zhenzhu?

459
22:48.190 --> 22:49.450
Li Si brought him back.

460
22:51.050 --> 22:52.990
Turns out he was the one who hid him.

461
22:53.020 --> 22:54.110
Tao, how is he?

462
22:54.400 --> 22:56.010
I can only say I'll do my best.

463
22:56.030 --> 22:56.820
What do you mean, "do your best"?

464
22:56.820 --> 22:58.040
You have to heal him!

465
22:58.400 --> 22:59.200
Yes.

466
22:59.770 --> 23:00.600
Where's Qingyang?

467
23:00.600 --> 23:03.000
He left after getting everything settled.

468
23:03.360 --> 23:05.020
How did he get hurt this badly?

469
23:11.260 --> 23:14.910
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

470
24:07.610 --> 24:09.010
Whether he pulls through

471
24:09.500 --> 24:11.630
will depend on the next couple of days.

472
24:18.010 --> 24:20.360
Brother, your kite is so high!

473
24:20.380 --> 24:21.880
Higher, please!

474
24:21.880 --> 24:22.550
Okay.

475
24:23.110 --> 24:24.550
Higher, please!

476
24:25.350 --> 24:26.880
Brother, higher!

477
24:26.900 --> 24:28.100
Higher!

478
24:28.160 --> 24:30.150
-A little higher! -Okay.

479
24:31.070 --> 24:32.110
Higher!

480
24:32.790 --> 24:33.590
Mother!

481
24:33.590 --> 24:34.030
Come on.

482
24:34.030 --> 24:35.260
Look.

483
24:35.440 --> 24:36.580
It's so high!

484
24:36.780 --> 24:37.980
Father!

485
24:42.450 --> 24:43.250
Come quickly!

486
24:44.200 --> 24:45.000
I'm coming.

487
24:45.200 --> 24:46.130
It's beautiful.

488
25:06.480 --> 25:07.270
We're back.

489
25:08.590 --> 25:10.400
Look, all these tonics.

490
25:10.600 --> 25:11.400
Qingyang,

491
25:11.560 --> 25:12.690
thank you for paying

492
25:12.720 --> 25:13.750
for Meng Rui's medicine.

493
25:13.750 --> 25:14.550
I appreciate your help, Yan.

494
25:14.550 --> 25:15.370
It's no trouble.

495
25:15.370 --> 25:16.030
Put them down.

496
25:16.030 --> 25:16.600
Okay.

497
25:16.620 --> 25:17.290
Tao,

498
25:17.840 --> 25:19.110
we have Lingzhi mushrooms from Haisong Mountain

499
25:19.110 --> 25:20.970
that are over a hundred years old,

500
25:21.080 --> 25:22.810
as well as snow-grown Cordyceps,

501
25:22.810 --> 25:23.990
Chonghua snow lotus,

502
25:23.990 --> 25:26.670
Polygonatum, dragon's blood, and white-banded snake.

503
25:26.670 --> 25:27.470
Take a look

504
25:27.830 --> 25:28.510
and see if there's anything

505
25:28.510 --> 25:29.720
that might be useful.

506
25:39.920 --> 25:41.070
Why aren't you saying anything?

507
25:41.070 --> 25:42.600
What's wrong with Meng Rui?

508
25:43.110 --> 25:45.110
His condition is stable for now,

509
25:46.110 --> 25:47.550
but strangely,

510
25:49.030 --> 25:50.000
he seems to be

511
25:50.000 --> 25:51.730
in a deep sleep, lost in a dream.

512
25:52.110 --> 25:53.040
And what's more,

513
25:53.400 --> 25:55.200
he doesn't even want to wake up.

514
25:59.890 --> 26:00.680
Ms. Bai,

515
26:01.030 --> 26:02.160
you're a physician.

516
26:02.510 --> 26:04.440
You should understand what I mean.

517
26:06.170 --> 26:07.610
Whether he wakes up

518
26:08.050 --> 26:09.820
depends on whether he wants to.

519
26:09.850 --> 26:11.110
Wait. What do you mean?

520
26:12.720 --> 26:13.840
I've heard of cases

521
26:14.360 --> 26:15.470
like this.

522
26:16.090 --> 26:17.050
When someone

523
26:17.570 --> 26:19.830
has been through a great deal of tragedy,

524
26:20.200 --> 26:23.000
if they're strong-minded in their everyday life,

525
26:23.280 --> 26:25.210
they may become unafraid of death.

526
26:25.580 --> 26:28.440
But once someone like that suffers a serious injury

527
26:28.460 --> 26:30.390
and can no longer remain rational,

528
26:30.960 --> 26:32.610
the will to live within them

529
26:32.820 --> 26:34.020
can easily fade away.

530
26:34.780 --> 26:35.950
Simply put,

531
26:36.420 --> 26:38.620
he doesn't even want to live anymore.

532
26:41.350 --> 26:42.160
I wonder what Mr. Meng

533
26:42.160 --> 26:43.490
must have been through.

534
26:43.570 --> 26:44.640
Wait. You mean

535
26:44.640 --> 26:46.440
he doesn't want to live anymore?

536
26:46.510 --> 26:47.510
But why?

537
26:55.960 --> 26:56.960
In this world,

538
26:57.530 --> 26:59.190
there are indeed many things,

539
26:59.500 --> 27:00.560
many experiences,

540
27:01.360 --> 27:03.820
that can make someone no longer want to live,

541
27:04.000 --> 27:06.260
that can make life feel worse than death.

542
27:30.160 --> 27:31.220
Mr. Meng,

543
27:32.200 --> 27:33.350
you have to hold on.

544
27:35.890 --> 27:36.840
I believe

545
27:37.330 --> 27:39.150
you wouldn't want this sword

546
27:39.910 --> 27:41.840
to fall silent forever, would you?

547
27:59.140 --> 28:03.790
[Severe-Cold]

548
28:11.510 --> 28:13.940
Brother, your kite is so high!

549
28:13.970 --> 28:15.340
Higher!

550
28:15.910 --> 28:17.390
Higher!

551
28:27.760 --> 28:28.760
Brother!

552
28:46.510 --> 28:48.270
Don't touch my sword.

553
28:48.770 --> 28:49.570
Meng Rui.

554
28:49.770 --> 28:50.450
He's awake.

555
28:50.470 --> 28:51.230
Meng!

556
28:51.260 --> 28:52.440
Meng is awake!

557
28:53.940 --> 28:55.210
-Meng. -Meng is awake!

558
28:55.270 --> 28:56.350
-Meng. -Meng is awake!

559
28:56.350 --> 28:57.500
Meng is awake.

560
28:57.550 --> 28:58.350
Meng!

561
28:58.920 --> 28:59.550
Meng Rui!

562
29:00.620 --> 29:02.570
[Severe-Cold]

563
29:04.030 --> 29:05.210
Meng is awake!

564
29:05.310 --> 29:06.270
Meng is awake!

565
29:06.270 --> 29:07.750
- Meng is awake! - Really? That's great!

566
29:07.750 --> 29:08.720
Lord Constable Ghost is awake!

567
29:08.720 --> 29:09.880
Jiang Zhan, hurry!

568
29:10.680 --> 29:11.750
Meng is awake!

569
29:11.790 --> 29:13.440
Mr. Meng is awake? That's wonderful!

570
29:11.820 --> 29:13.330
[Chief Constable's Hall]

571
29:13.440 --> 29:14.310
Chief!

572
29:14.920 --> 29:16.100
Chief!

573
29:17.290 --> 29:18.260
Reporting, Chief.

574
29:18.260 --> 29:19.400
Meng is awake!

575
29:32.850 --> 29:34.270
- Meng! - Meng!

576
29:34.640 --> 29:35.240
Meng!

577
29:35.240 --> 29:35.960
- You're not fully recovered yet. - Meng!

578
29:35.960 --> 29:36.680
- You can't go! - Meng!

579
29:36.680 --> 29:37.680
I have to go.

580
29:37.680 --> 29:38.680
Stay right there!

581
29:39.840 --> 29:41.570
You were only well for two days.

582
29:41.880 --> 29:43.310
What are you up to now?

583
29:44.830 --> 29:46.090
I need to see the Chief.

584
29:46.410 --> 29:47.870
Why can't you just behave?

585
29:55.330 --> 29:57.240
The Chief went to see His Majesty

586
29:57.350 --> 29:58.640
and hasn't returned yet.

587
29:58.640 --> 29:59.880
If I were you,

588
30:00.350 --> 30:02.160
I'd stay put

589
30:02.160 --> 30:03.560
and get some proper rest.

590
30:03.590 --> 30:04.400
After all,

591
30:04.910 --> 30:07.800
there's no need to rush.

592
30:08.680 --> 30:10.700
The Liluo Night Demons are running wild.

593
30:10.700 --> 30:12.110
How can I rest easy?

594
30:12.110 --> 30:13.400
You just crawled back

595
30:13.400 --> 30:13.960
from hell,

596
30:13.960 --> 30:15.030
so don't push your luck.

597
30:15.030 --> 30:15.830
What?

598
30:16.260 --> 30:17.350
You think the Divine Constable Bureau

599
30:17.350 --> 30:18.880
can't get by without you?

600
30:20.240 --> 30:21.030
Yan,

601
30:21.050 --> 30:22.070
that's just how Meng Rui is.

602
30:22.070 --> 30:23.600
You should know that by now.

603
30:26.090 --> 30:27.260
Where are you going?

604
30:27.630 --> 30:28.740
Physician Tao said

605
30:28.760 --> 30:30.450
Mr. Meng mustn't move around yet.

606
30:30.450 --> 30:31.880
Carry him to the sedan chair!

607
30:31.880 --> 30:32.590
Do you hear that?

608
30:32.590 --> 30:32.830
Understood.

609
30:32.830 --> 30:34.070
Get him out of here!

610
30:34.070 --> 30:34.510
Hurry!

611
30:34.510 --> 30:35.110
Please, Meng.

612
30:35.110 --> 30:35.770
Let go of me!

613
30:35.770 --> 30:36.690
Sit still!

614
30:36.850 --> 30:38.890
Just sit back and relax.

615
30:38.910 --> 30:39.670
Lord Yan,

616
30:39.750 --> 30:40.940
look after Lord Meng.

617
30:40.940 --> 30:42.380
Leave him to me.

618
30:42.440 --> 30:43.640
Lift the sedan chair!

619
30:44.260 --> 30:45.960
You little rascal. Got you now!

620
30:45.960 --> 30:46.720
Put me down!

621
30:46.750 --> 30:48.210
Yan, I need to see the Chief!

622
30:48.210 --> 30:50.420
- You will. - Mr. Meng, don't worry.

623
30:50.750 --> 30:52.310
We'll get you home

624
30:52.310 --> 30:53.030
safe and sound.

625
30:53.030 --> 30:53.830
You got it!

626
30:53.960 --> 30:54.750
Li Si!

627
31:05.680 --> 31:08.120
- Grand Secretary Bai. - Grand Secretary Bai.

628
31:08.120 --> 31:10.040
[Chief Constable's Hall]

629
31:11.830 --> 31:12.640
Father?

630
31:13.790 --> 31:14.590
Zhenzhu.

631
31:15.550 --> 31:16.680
What brings you here?

632
31:16.680 --> 31:18.150
You could've told me first.

633
31:18.150 --> 31:20.140
I'm the Prime Minister, after all.

634
31:20.170 --> 31:21.510
Am I not allowed to visit?

635
31:21.330 --> 31:23.290
[Head Constable's Hall]

636
31:21.960 --> 31:22.830
Besides,

637
31:22.830 --> 31:23.480
I'm your father.

638
31:23.480 --> 31:25.240
Isn't it only natural to visit

639
31:25.240 --> 31:26.510
my daughter's workplace?

640
31:26.130 --> 31:28.610
[Head Constable's Hall]

641
31:26.680 --> 31:27.480
Yes.

642
31:28.740 --> 31:31.150
[Pillar of the Realm]

643
31:31.160 --> 31:32.720
Father, have some tea.

644
31:33.790 --> 31:35.520
Did you need something from me?

645
31:36.830 --> 31:37.590
Zhenzhu,

646
31:37.590 --> 31:38.750
I had this sachet custom-made

647
31:38.750 --> 31:39.640
for you.

648
31:39.880 --> 31:40.680
Look,

649
31:40.830 --> 31:42.880
aren't the pearls on it beautiful?

650
31:42.900 --> 31:43.690
Here.

651
31:43.720 --> 31:44.810
Come on, take it.

652
31:46.680 --> 31:47.480
Father,

653
31:47.820 --> 31:49.710
I don't really use these.

654
31:50.090 --> 31:51.830
It contains precious spices

655
31:51.830 --> 31:53.290
from the Western Regions.

656
31:53.780 --> 31:56.090
Its rich fragrance lasts all year.

657
31:56.120 --> 31:57.410
You're a young woman,

658
31:57.430 --> 31:59.130
dealing with corpses every day.

659
31:59.130 --> 32:00.960
You should take better care of yourself.

660
32:00.960 --> 32:02.200
Come on, take it.

661
32:02.480 --> 32:03.280
Be a good girl.

662
32:03.960 --> 32:04.750
Father.

663
32:05.480 --> 32:06.160
Your daughter

664
32:06.160 --> 32:07.990
isn't like those rich young ladies.

665
32:07.990 --> 32:09.910
Besides, this is official business.

666
32:09.910 --> 32:11.640
All you ever care about is work.

667
32:12.530 --> 32:13.480
Zhenzhu,

668
32:13.510 --> 32:15.220
why don't you come home with me?

669
32:15.220 --> 32:16.950
You're already twenty-three.

670
32:17.010 --> 32:18.620
It's time you got married.

671
32:19.160 --> 32:19.960
Father.

672
32:20.070 --> 32:20.680
Can't you

673
32:20.680 --> 32:22.340
stop making decisions for me?

674
32:24.830 --> 32:26.100
It's all Xuanyuan's fault

675
32:26.100 --> 32:27.610
for taking such a liking to you!

676
32:27.610 --> 32:28.960
I'd say

677
32:28.960 --> 32:30.580
your Bureau got quite a bargain!

678
32:30.580 --> 32:31.970
How can you say that?

679
32:31.990 --> 32:32.510
The Bureau

680
32:32.510 --> 32:33.480
pays me a salary, too,

681
32:33.480 --> 32:33.960
you know.

682
32:33.960 --> 32:35.480
With that meager salary of yours,

683
32:35.480 --> 32:37.350
you'd rather stretch every coin

684
32:37.350 --> 32:38.500
than take money from home.

685
32:38.500 --> 32:40.230
Does our money burn your hands?

686
32:40.270 --> 32:41.270
My money, my rules.

687
32:41.270 --> 32:42.330
I'm happy that way.

688
32:51.480 --> 32:52.270
Father.

689
32:52.960 --> 32:54.270
You can rest assured.

690
32:54.350 --> 32:56.110
I can take care of myself.

691
32:56.390 --> 32:57.590
Don't worry about me.

692
33:02.270 --> 33:03.070
All right.

693
33:03.830 --> 33:06.270
It's time I headed back.

694
33:08.070 --> 33:08.830
Father!

695
33:11.730 --> 33:12.780
Take this back.

696
33:12.810 --> 33:14.070
I really don't need it.

697
33:23.120 --> 33:26.490
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

698
33:30.330 --> 33:31.330
Master is here.

699
33:46.920 --> 33:48.880
You two may leave.

700
33:49.060 --> 33:49.860
Yes, sir.

701
33:51.420 --> 33:53.350
Sorry to keep you waiting, Ms. Bai.

702
33:55.850 --> 33:57.880
This must be your first time

703
33:57.910 --> 34:00.110
dining at my Star-Gathering Pavilion.

704
34:00.270 --> 34:01.340
I've investigated cases here,

705
34:01.340 --> 34:03.130
but never dined here before.

706
34:07.260 --> 34:08.830
You saved my father, Lord Li.

707
34:08.830 --> 34:10.540
So it's only right

708
34:10.690 --> 34:12.290
that I treat you to this meal.

709
34:20.590 --> 34:21.400
Please, sit.

710
34:25.730 --> 34:26.600
Ms. Bai,

711
34:29.320 --> 34:31.710
no need for formalities.

712
34:31.730 --> 34:33.370
Just call me by my name.

713
34:33.590 --> 34:34.770
Calling me "Lord"

714
34:34.800 --> 34:36.110
seems a bit too formal.

715
34:43.560 --> 34:45.960
There's something

716
34:46.670 --> 34:48.270
I've been meaning to ask you.

717
34:49.989 --> 34:51.030
Go ahead, Ms. Bai.

718
34:52.050 --> 34:53.219
May I ask, Master Li,

719
34:53.620 --> 34:55.280
what's your true background?

720
35:01.430 --> 35:02.470
I suspect

721
35:03.370 --> 35:04.860
you're not the only one

722
35:05.710 --> 35:06.800
in our bureau

723
35:06.800 --> 35:08.060
who's been wondering.

724
35:18.580 --> 35:21.740
Have you ever played Go?

725
35:25.840 --> 35:27.110
I'm like

726
35:27.510 --> 35:28.800
a piece

727
35:28.800 --> 35:29.920
on a Go board.

728
35:33.860 --> 35:35.790
I once occupied the central point.

729
35:36.010 --> 35:37.350
The pieces on all sides

730
35:37.850 --> 35:39.450
seemed to pay me due respect,

731
35:39.780 --> 35:43.290
but were secretly plotting to kill me.

732
35:44.920 --> 35:46.280
How could you respond?

733
35:50.580 --> 35:51.870
It's a chained ko.

734
35:52.830 --> 35:54.830
If two opposing pieces join forces,

735
35:55.050 --> 35:56.580
I have no chance of winning.

736
36:02.280 --> 36:03.070
Besides,

737
36:04.080 --> 36:05.000
I'm nothing more

738
36:05.000 --> 36:06.330
than a mere chess piece.

739
36:07.240 --> 36:09.220
The player doesn't care

740
36:09.920 --> 36:12.130
what becomes of a single piece.

741
36:13.580 --> 36:14.820
So it seems

742
36:15.530 --> 36:16.990
you're a sacrificed pawn.

743
36:18.100 --> 36:19.180
That's right.

744
36:21.710 --> 36:27.740
[Wind and Moon]

745
36:25.630 --> 36:27.320
Look at your vast estate,

746
36:28.300 --> 36:30.430
not to mention your wisdom and skills.

747
36:30.760 --> 36:32.560
You claim to be a discarded pawn?

748
36:32.710 --> 36:33.770
I don't believe it.

749
36:41.310 --> 36:44.230
You're wrong, Ms. Bai.

750
36:45.350 --> 36:46.610
Even a discarded piece

751
36:47.020 --> 36:48.670
has its purpose.

752
36:51.910 --> 36:52.730
In the hands

753
36:52.760 --> 36:54.830
of someone cunning and unpredictable,

754
36:54.830 --> 36:57.870
even a discarded piece can become a killing piece.

755
37:01.810 --> 37:03.640
The man you see before you

756
37:04.270 --> 37:06.500
is one who can crush all opposition.

757
37:08.160 --> 37:09.440
But in the end,

758
37:10.040 --> 37:11.260
win or lose,

759
37:11.290 --> 37:12.890
it's all just a game of chess.

760
37:13.290 --> 37:15.130
Whether you're a sacrificed piece

761
37:15.130 --> 37:16.820
doesn't really matter.

762
37:16.850 --> 37:18.880
But what if the game is big enough

763
37:21.070 --> 37:23.240
to encompass an entire world?

764
37:23.730 --> 37:25.460
And the pieces on the board

765
37:25.840 --> 37:27.770
are the common people themselves.

766
37:28.440 --> 37:29.590
Would you still say

767
37:29.630 --> 37:30.690
it doesn't matter?

768
37:39.620 --> 37:41.080
For the sake of the people,

769
37:42.930 --> 37:45.630
we cannot afford to lose.

770
37:48.000 --> 37:48.710
So what if I become

771
37:48.710 --> 37:50.840
a pawn controlled by others?

772
37:51.760 --> 37:53.760
Even if I'm torn to pieces,

773
37:54.560 --> 37:56.950
I'll press on without hesitation.

774
38:22.060 --> 38:24.690
[Tianshu Pavilion]

775
38:22.880 --> 38:23.630
Li Si,

776
38:24.230 --> 38:26.760
you captured Prince Wenbu in the Black Chest Case

777
38:26.760 --> 38:28.400
and averted a crisis on Great Shi's borders.

778
38:28.130 --> 38:36.660
[Tianshu Pavilion]

779
38:28.710 --> 38:30.570
You deserve the greatest credit.

780
38:30.930 --> 38:31.960
Constable Frost and Constable Iron

781
38:31.960 --> 38:33.620
have also praised you highly.

782
38:34.320 --> 38:35.510
In recognition

783
38:35.510 --> 38:36.830
of your outstanding achievements,

784
38:36.830 --> 38:38.070
you are hereby promoted

785
38:38.070 --> 38:39.400
to Divine Constable of the Bureau.

786
38:38.950 --> 38:40.930
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

787
38:39.630 --> 38:42.090
You are granted the Divine Constable Tally.

788
38:54.510 --> 38:56.010
Thank you, Chief.

789
38:55.940 --> 38:56.410
[Divine Constable Tally]

790
38:57.420 --> 38:58.990
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

791
39:02.080 --> 39:05.180
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

792
39:11.150 --> 39:18.240
[Tianshu Pavilion]

793
39:53.230 --> 39:55.960
Tianshu Pavilion holds all the world's secrets.

794
39:56.510 --> 39:58.510
Its archives are organized

795
39:58.600 --> 40:01.400
according to the hidden codes of heaven and earth.

796
40:03.040 --> 40:05.010
Section Jia records royal affairs

797
40:05.030 --> 40:06.890
and secrets of the imperial clan.

798
40:08.910 --> 40:11.280
Section Yi covers criminal cases, cold cases,

799
40:11.280 --> 40:12.630
and martial-world vendettas.

800
40:12.000 --> 40:15.020
[Heaven]

801
40:13.630 --> 40:15.510
Section Bing covers astronomy and astrology,

802
40:15.060 --> 40:17.550
[Jiashen] [Jiawu] [Jiaxu]

803
40:15.760 --> 40:17.690
as well as geography and feng shui.

804
40:19.440 --> 40:20.440
And so on.

805
40:19.560 --> 40:20.610
[Bingyin] [Bingzi] [Bingxu] [Bingjia]

806
40:20.760 --> 40:21.500
[Water]

807
40:20.800 --> 40:22.480
The princes' hunt grounds, year 20 of Hongyun,

808
40:22.300 --> 40:22.640
[Wind]

809
40:22.510 --> 40:23.810
the burning disaster.

810
40:23.830 --> 40:25.250
Jia represents imperial power,

811
40:25.250 --> 40:27.000
while Mao represents the eastern spring wood,

812
40:27.000 --> 40:29.930
corresponding to Mulan Hunting Ground's location.

813
40:34.710 --> 40:37.490
Even the shelves' arrangement seems to mock the fact

814
40:37.490 --> 40:38.440
that Zhou Yan died

815
40:38.440 --> 40:40.900
in February, when all things spring to life.

816
40:41.790 --> 40:44.730
[Imperial Secrets]

817
40:42.670 --> 40:43.360
That must be

818
40:43.360 --> 40:45.230
the imperial secret on the Mao shelf in Section Jia.
